Subject: [PATCH 5.10 CANDIDATE 09/15] fs: move S_ISGID stripping into the vfs_*() helpers
Date:   Fri, 17 Mar 2023 13:08:11 +0200
Message-Id: <20230317110817.1226324-10-amir73il@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
In-Reply-To: <20230317110817.1226324-1-amir73il@gmail.com>
